  "summary": "Cookie exfiltration payload distributed via unpkg CDN",
  "details": "The package ships a single browser script whose only behavior is to read document.cookie and send it to a hardcoded webhook.site collector (https://webhook.site/c226090c-12b0-462e-81d2-e632c7a58833/) by setting new Image().src to a URL containing the cookie value. The package manifest declares an `unpkg` entry so the file is served directly by the unpkg CDN and can be embedded as a <script> in any target page. The script also calls alert(11) and the manifest carries no meaningful description, consistent with a proof-of-concept cookie-theft payload rather than a legitimate library.",
